    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build towers by choosing their material, archetype, weapon type, and core purity, which will result in different rarities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/dd43e12efe02c363f82e0cca91553958.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/dd43e12efe02c363f82e0cca91553958.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own strategies by modifying the routes on the maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the maps, you'll find fissures where you can collect materials to craft towers and upgrade equipment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies will drop crystallized mana and some rare materials needed on different occasions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft towers and upgrade your equipment to overcome difficulties and unravel the mystery of the Land of Anima.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build towers by choosing their material, archetype, weapon type, and core purity, which will result in different rarities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/dd43e12efe02c363f82e0cca91553958.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/dd43e12efe02c363f82e0cca91553958.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own strategies by modifying the routes on the maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/7a86bfe70e3b58f04f80d7f4052ed35f.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the maps, you'll find fissures where you can collect materials to craft towers and upgrade equipment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/c9eb88abb0e192e3e2d98fd2616cad45.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies will drop crystallized mana and some rare materials needed on different occasions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/d2ceadb95e00a44e830e43e0bb21e34c.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft towers and upgrade your equipment to overcome difficulties and unravel the mystery of the Land of Anima.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.poster.avif?t=1749745701\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.webm?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/extras/33afcb3dbd37bf1c8b7248b635f1f444.mp4?t=1749745701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
